  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Regional Coop statistics</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Regionalt statistiksamarb</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Statistics is key information when a country is approximating its system with the EU or inititates a Public Administrative reform. Statistics Sweden will develop a regional strategy for statistics in the balkans and will open a representation office in the field. Expected results are better coordination with the statistical offices and other donors and a better efficiency in the ongoing projects.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Statistik &#xE4;r ett nyckelomr&#xE5;de vid f&#xF6;rvaltningsreform och Balkan l&#xE4;ndernas str&#xE4;van att n&#xE4;rma sig EU.Projektet g&#xE5;r ut p&#xE5; att SCB tar fram en regional sterategi f&#xF6;r att skapa klarhet i de svenska insatserna samt att SCB placerar en representant i regionen. F&#xF6;rv&#xE4;ntat resultat &#xE4;r st&#xF6;rre l&#xE5;ngsiktighet, en b&#xE4;ttre koordination med mottagare och andra givare, st&#xF6;rre effektivitet i bist&#xE5;ndet.</narrative>
  </description>
